<title>FINLAND: ARCTOS BUYS INTO CANADIAN BIO-TECH FIRM.</title>
<headline>ARCTOS BUYS INTO CANADIAN BIO-TECH FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish investment company Arctos Capital Oy said in a statement on Monday it bought a 2.5 percent stake in Canadian bio-tech company Supratek Pharma Inc for 0.9 million Canadian dollars.  </p>
<p>Arctos said it had taken part in an offering targetted at institutional investors, purchasing 420,000 Supratek series A shares and 105,000 warrants for C$2.15 per share.</p>
<p>Montreal based Supratek, operating in the drug delivery technology business, plans to seek a listing in 1-3 years, Arctos said.</p>
<p>Supratek could become a forerunner in the treatment of for example cancer and AIDS, it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 248, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
